Area with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<area id= 'x' >]
Base with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<base id= 'x' >]
Column with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<col id= 'x' >]
Embed with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<embed id= 'x' >]
PageBreak with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<hr id= 'x' >]
Image with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<img id= 'x' >]
MetaData with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<meta id= 'x' >]
Parameter with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<param id= 'x' >]
Source with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<source id= 'x' >]
Track with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<track id= 'x' >]
WordBreak with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<wbr id= 'x' >]
LineBreak with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<br id= 'x' >]
Input with SetIdentifier(x) Generate() = [<input id= 'x' />]
LineBreak with no attributes Generate() = [<br>]
